<article class="panel-card" id="finance">
    <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><div><h2 class="section-title">待辦事項</h2><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-[#8b97a9]">今天有 5 件事需要你的注意</p></div><span class="flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#fff1ee] text-[11px] font-bold text-[#dc7869]">5</span></div>
    <div class="mt-5 space-y-1">
