    <div class="mt-5 border-t border-[#edf0f5] pt-5"><p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#a0aaba]">快速操作</p><div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2"><button type="button" data-toast="新增銷售訂單功能準備中。" class="quick-action"><span class="quick-action-icon bg-[#eaf8f0] text-[#43ae79]"><svg class="size-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><span>新增訂單</span></button><button type="button" data-toast="新增商品功能準備中。" class="quick-action"><span class="quick-action-icon bg-[#edf3ff] text-[#6f8bd2]"><svg class="size-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m10 3.5 6 3.25v6.5l-6 3.25-6-3.25v-6.5l6-3.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M7 8.5h6M10 7v5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><span>新增商品</span></button><button type="button" data-toast="建立請款單功能準備中。" class="quick-action"><span class="quick-action-icon bg-[#fff4e7] text-[#d69643]"><svg class="size-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="3.5" width="12" height="13" rx="1.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M7 7h6M7 10h6M7 13h3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><span>建立請款</span></button></div></div>
